e_id":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/placeholders","content":"These are distinct from prepared statements which are handled by the MySQL server; you can use `MySQL.prepare` for more optimised and secure queries."},"819":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","type":"page","content":"Using the Debug UI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","OxMySQL"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui"},"820":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-0","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#main-page","content":"Main page"},"821":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-1","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"Resource page"},"822":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-2","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"The debug UI lets you easily see all the queries that have been executed by resources, query response times, and per-resource statistics.\nYou should only enable this during development, or with a small player count - for larger servers, look into builtin MySQL logging."},"823":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-3","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"Before using the UI first you have to make sure you have the `mysql_ui` convar set to true:"},"824":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-4","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"Also make sure that you have `command` or `command.mysql` ace permission access, then you should be able to use the `mysql` command in game."},"825":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-5","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","content":"You *do not* need to have the `mysql_debug` enabled to use the debug ui."},"826":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-6","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#main-page","content":"The main page shows you the resources that ran queries where you can filter them through a search bar, your general data\nalong side a pie chart which shows what resources took the most query time."},"827":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-7","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"The resource page shows you all the queries and their execution time inside a table that the resource previously ran,\nalongside the total amount of the queries, execution time and slow queries for the selected resource."},"828":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-8","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"Columns can be sorted by ascending and descending order, and hovering over a query will display the full query inside a tooltip."},"829":{"id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui-9","page_id":"/docs/oxmysql/ui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/oxmysql/ui#resource-page","content":"Queries that exceed `mysql_slow_query_warning` (default 150ms) are displayed in orange.\\\nFor demonstation purposes the `mysql_slow_query_warning` convar was set to 5 here."},"830":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","type":"page","content":"Fivemanage","tags":[],"url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage"},"831":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage-0","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","content":"Fivemanage"},"832":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage-1","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","content":"Fivemanage is an all-in-one SaaS platform for communities looking to improve their workflow, offering a range of features to faciliate easier management\nand administration of your FiveM server. They offer fast and reliable content delivery - with full support for image, video, and audio files - and seamless\nlogging to track player and server activity while ensuring dependable performance and security."},"833":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage-2","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","content":"Fivemanage integrates seamlessly into your FiveM server with native support via ox\\_lib and oxmysql, or through their official FiveM SDK."},"834":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage-3","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","content":"They offer a generous free plan with enough storage to get you started, and a variety of paid plans designed for both small and large servers needing access to more storage and advanced feeatures."},"835":{"id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage-4","page_id":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/fivemanage","content":"Get started with Fivemanage today."},"836":{"id":"/docs/resources","page_id":"/docs/resources","type":"page","content":"Resources","tags":[],"url":"/docs/resources"},"837":{"id":"/docs/resources/prism-host","page_id":"/docs/resources/prism-host","type":"page","content":"Prism Host","tags":[],"url":"/docs/resources/prism-host"},"838":{"id":"/docs/resources/prism-host-0","page_id":"/docs/resources/prism-host","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/prism-host","content":"Prism Host delivers performance-focused hosting without the inflated price tag. From game servers and VPS to dedicated hardware and web hosting, we build around fast hardware, practical pricing, and responsive support."},"839":{"id":"/docs/resources/prism-host-1","page_id":"/docs/resources/prism-host","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/resources/prism-host","content":"Get started with Prism Host today using the code `OVEREXTENDED` at checkout."},"840":{"id":"/docs/resources/tebex-creators","page_id":"/docs/resources/tebex-creators","type":"page","content":"Tebex Creators","tags":[],"url":"/docs/resources/tebex-creators"},"841":{"id":"/docs/resources/tebex-creators-0","page_id":"/docs/resources/tebex-creators","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/